    <div class="cm-split">
      <div class="cm-tree" data-keep="1">
        <div class="cm-tree-hd">
          <div class="row1"><span class="lbl">분류 트리</span><span class="ro">읽기 전용</span></div>
          <div class="cm-modes" role="group" aria-label="트리 범위">
            <button type="button" class="cm-mode" id="cmModeCat" data-action="set-treemode" data-m="category">직속만</button>
            <button type="button" class="cm-mode" id="cmModeSub" data-action="set-treemode" data-m="subtree">하위 포함</button>
          </div>
          <div class="cm-tree-note" id="cmTreeNote"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cm-tree-body" id="cmTreeBody"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cm-listcol">
        <div class="cm-thead">
          <button type="button" class="cm-check" id="cmHeadCheck" data-action="toggle-page-all"
                  role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" aria-label="이 페이지 전체 선택" data-keep="1"></button>
          <span>상품명</span><span>상품코드</span><span>부품 종류</span><span>현재 분류</span>
          <span style="text-align:right">판매가</span><span style="text-align:right">재고</span><span>상태</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cm-tbody" id="cmTbody" data-keep="1"></div>
        <div class="cm-pager" data-keep="1">
